  "title": "Tronox Issues 2025 Sustainability Report",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., June 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Tronox Holdings plc (NYSE:TROX) (“Tronox” or the “Company”), the world’s leading integrated manufacturer of titanium dioxide pigment, announced today the publication of its 2025 sustainability report. The report highlights the Company’s progress during 2025, including the achievement of its 2025 sustainability-related targets, and underscores Tronox’s commitment to preserving its … Continue reading \"Tronox Issues 2025 Sustainability Report\"",
